      "title": {
        "en": "Exotic bird varieties with housing concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors appreciate the extensive selection of exotic birds, parrots, hamsters, and reptiles available for purchase. However, multiple customer reviews raise serious concerns regarding animal well-being, citing overcrowded cages, sick fish, and neglected reptiles, with several owners reporting that purchased geckos died shortly after adoption."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Traditional neighborhood shop with varied upkeep"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many longtime customers enjoy the nostalgic, old-school atmosphere of this neighborhood pet shop, appreciating fully stocked shelves of pet food and pet supplies. Conversely, critical reviewers point to unpleasant odors and poor enclosure maintenance, advising prospective buyers to inspect animal enclosures before buying."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive advice alongside customer service complaints"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Feedback on store personnel is split. Several reviewers highlight helpful assistance from younger employees who trimmed puppy nails, assisted with bird choices, and organized vaccine clinics. In contrast, other patrons report dismissive or curt interactions with senior staff members and feeling pressured to leave the store."
      }
    }
  ],
